    "description": "<p>Using this Charm, a Vizier can make other people want to please him; actually harming him seems unthinkable. For the scene, anyone whose character wants to attack the Sidereal must succeed at a Conviction roll with a difficulty equal to the Sidereal's Essence. Knowingly acting in a way that will not please the Sidereal requires a successful Temperance roll at the same difficulty. What's more, any roll made for the Sidereal to seduce someone receives a number of bonus successes equal to the Sidereal's Essence.</p>",
